  "David Luebbert"
 ],
 "summary": "Microsoft's text-based document interchange format: plain 7-bit text made of control words (\\b, \\par, \\fs24), control symbols and {groups} that scope formatting state, with \"destinations\" for header tables, fields, pictures and embedded objects.",
 "status": "maintained",
 "defined_by": [
